//===== rAthena Script =======================================
//= Job change : Spirit Handler
//===== Description: =========================================
//- [Walkthrough conversion]
//- The translation is not from iRO.
//- Step 14 takes place in an instance (npc/re/instance/DeepForest.txt)
//- Total : 15 steps.
